  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention of Malaria through Vector Control (PMVC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the PMVC contract, Abt and its partners will work with country governments to integrate indoor residual spray campaigns with distribution of insecticide treated nets--two proven, life-saving malaria vector control interventionsas well as new tools adopted by PMI such as larval source management.</narrative>
